@versions
go-to: mod_info

Version 0.0.1.

Added:

Party actions.

Reformist, left and center paths were added.

Substantial nerfs to lot of actions.

Time is twice as slower.

Party congresses. Shuffle leadership is removed.

DNVP and DVP congresses.

New factions. 

Reaction from establishment.

Lot of QOL and balance changes.

